  "prefLabel": "Env-A 1818.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 1818.01 Purpose. The purpose of the rules in this part is to implement RSA 141-E:11, I, which requires individuals who disturb asbestos at an ADS to be trained and certified.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1, Revision Note #2, and Revision Note #3 at chapter heading for Env-A 1800) #14104, eff 11-1-24, EXPIRES: 11-1-34",
